 Essential Job Requirements 
 · Bachelor's Degree in Marketing, Management or related field required 
 · Excellent command of the English language is a MUST and knowledge of additional languages is a plus 
 · Minimum of a year of combined internship and professional marketing experience required 
 · Marketing experience in a professional services environment preferred 
 · Proficiency with MS Office applications including Powerpoint, Word, Outlook, and Excel is required 
 · Multitasking and time management are vital to this role and are required 
 Personal Characteristics 
 · Excellent written and spoken communication skills 
 · Bright, ambitious, self-driven, hard-working and flexible 
 · Ability to work under tight deadlines and cope with pressure 
 · Able to perform under pressure and deliver results in a demanding and fast-paced environment that requires fresh thinking and innovation 
 · Attention to detail
